    "Retain missing local Sheet_Title=quoted sheet display name and Print_Area=#REF! at A1 with stable sheet IDs.",
    "Explicit local definitions fill the permanent names without adding duplicates.",
    "Model records flow through existing public lookup, evaluator, INDIRECT/dependency traversal and XML/BIFF/XLSX serializers; no duplicate evaluator fallback or snapshot mutation.",
    "Native formula-string escaping handles embedded quotes and backslashes; existing work/cancellation ticks bound added processing."
  ],
